{"id":"n52129-1-8","stage":4,"title":"또렷하다 · 清晰的","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n52129-1-8-1","ko":"눈이 나빠졌는지 책의 글씨가 잘 안 보여.","zh":"我的眼睛好像变差了，看不清书上的字。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"눈이","meaning":"视力，眼神","explanation":"눈：视力，眼神；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"눈","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72704","senseId":"2","lemma":"눈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나빠졌는지","meaning":"有害，不好；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"나쁘다：有害，不好；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"나쁘다","audio":"/audio/b67c592bde724aa15bfa.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26816","senseId":"4","lemma":"나쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"책의","meaning":"书，书籍，画册","explanation":"책：书，书籍，画册；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71468","senseId":"1","lemma":"책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"글씨가","meaning":"字体，字迹，笔迹","explanation":"글씨：字体，字迹，笔迹；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"글씨","audio":"/audio/510fc81ede633cdb436d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60239","senseId":"1","lemma":"글씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"清楚地，仔细地","explanation":"잘：清楚地，仔细地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"2","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보여.","meaning":"可见，看得到","explanation":"보이다：可见，看得到；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"3","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ab1b14816087979d","term":"눈","zh":"视力，眼神","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3","entryId":"72704","definition":"能辨别判断事物存在或形态的眼睛的能力。","pronunciation":["눈"]},{"id":"b67c592bde724aa1","term":"나쁘다","zh":"有害，不好","audio":"/audio/b67c592bde724aa15bfa.mp3","entryId":"26816","definition":"不利于健康。","pronunciation":["나쁘다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]},{"id":"ba928dd573a2db9e","term":"책","zh":"书，书籍，画册","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3","entryId":"71468","definition":"把文章或画印刷之后装订成册而成的物品。","pronunciation":["책"]},{"id":"510fc81ede633cdb","term":"글씨","zh":"字体，字迹，笔迹","audio":"/audio/510fc81ede633cdb436d.mp3","entryId":"60239","definition":"书写的字的模样。","pronunciation":["글씨"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"清楚地，仔细地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"分明而准确地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"可见，看得到","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"某种结果出来。","pronunciation":["보이다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9ff086e348039fea8c9c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n52129-1-8-2","ko":"이 안경을 쓰면 또렷하게 보일 거야.","zh":"戴上这副眼镜就能看清楚了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안경을","meaning":"眼镜","explanation":"안경：眼镜；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"안경","audio":"/audio/7c40f615a28bcb4a9828.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31484","senseId":"1","lemma":"안경","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쓰면","meaning":"戴","explanation":"쓰다：戴；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65173","senseId":"2","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"또렷하게","meaning":"清晰的，明确的","explanation":"또렷하다：清晰的，明确的；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"또렷하다","audio":"/audio/604acb9275e0354cb5f0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"52129","senseId":"1","lemma":"또렷하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보일","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"7c40f615a28bcb4a","term":"안경","zh":"眼镜","audio":"/audio/7c40f615a28bcb4a9828.mp3","entryId":"31484","definition":"为了保护眼睛或矫正视力而戴在眼睛上的东西。","pronunciation":["안ː경"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"戴","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"65173","definition":"将某物挂或罩在脸上。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]},{"id":"604acb9275e0354c","term":"또렷하다","zh":"清晰的，明确的","audio":"/audio/604acb9275e0354cb5f0.mp3","entryId":"52129","definition":"清晰而确实的。","pronunciation":["또려타다"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"看起来，看上去","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"认为或判断出某对象怎样。","pronunciation":["보이다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/363f43b891aa62dccad1.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.105,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=52129","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":147,"sequenceScore":2.9317,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我的眼睛好像变差了，看不清书上的字。","戴上这副眼镜就能看清楚了。","冬天太冷了，我就先不运动了。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我的眼睛好像变差了，看不清书上的字。","戴上这副眼镜就能看清楚了。","冬天太冷了，我就先不运动了。"],"answer":1}]}
